  <div class="cv-chips"><span class="cv-chip off">環境與能源</span><span class="cv-chip off">健康與社會福利</span><a class="cv-chip" href="/issues/expose/"><svg class="cv-cic" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M192,64V77.33a8,8,0,0,1-1.6,4.8l-20.8,27.74a8,8,0,0,0-1.6,4.8V224a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H96a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V114.67a8,8,0,0,0-1.6-4.8L65.6,82.13a8,8,0,0,1-1.6-4.8V64Z" opacity="0.2"/><path d="M184,16H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,32V77.33a16.12,16.12,0,0,0,3.2,9.6L80,114.67V224a16,16,0,0,0,16,16h64a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V114.67l20.8-27.74a16.12,16.12,0,0,0,3.2-9.6V32A16,16,0,0,0,184,16ZM72,32H184V56H72V32Zm91.2,73.07a16.12,16.12,0,0,0-3.2,9.6V224H96V114.67a16.12,16.12,0,0,0-3.2-9.6L72,77.33V72H184v5.33ZM136,120v32a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V120a8,8,0,0,1,16,0Z"/></svg>廉政監督與揭露真相</a><a class="cv-chip" href="/issues/youth/"><svg class="cv-cic" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M224,128a96,96,0,1,1-96-96A96,96,0,0,1,224,128Z" opacity="0.2"/><path d="M92,140a12,12,0,1,1,12-12A12,12,0,0,1,92,140Zm72-24a12,12,0,1,0,12,12A12,12,0,0,0,164,116Zm-12.27,45.23a45,45,0,0,1-47.46,0,8,8,0,0,0-8.54,13.54,61,61,0,0,0,64.54,0,8,8,0,0,0-8.54-13.54ZM232,128A104,104,0,1,1,128,24,104.11,104.11,0,0,1,232,128Zm-16,0a88.11,88.11,0,0,0-84.09-87.91C120.32,56.38,120,71.88,120,72a8,8,0,0,0,16,0,8,8,0,0,1,16,0,24,24,0,0,1-48,0c0-.73.13-14.3,8.46-30.63A88,88,0,1,0,216,128Z"/></svg>兒少與教育</a><span class="cv-chip off">文化與地方認同</span></div>
</div></section>
  
